{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267QCATQzl6b1794376073.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國洛杉磯有汽車撞向行人路，三人死亡，司機及另外兩名行人情況危殆。</p><p></p><p>現場片段見到，肇事白色汽車嚴重損毀，消防及緊急救援人員到場善後。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.CAR-1330.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dB0z14Sntc1794376076.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>事發在當地周二傍晚6點前不久，北荷李活地鐵站口附近，汽車在繁忙的十字路口撞上行人路上的食品攤位，超過五人被撞到，三人當場死亡。約60歲的司機及兩名行人在內，至少三人被送院治療。</p><p></p><p>當局指未確定事故原因，正檢查司機有否受酒精或藥物影響。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:33:41.396978+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:37:12.926263+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:27:07.718572+00:00","content_hash":"27fa776d97f82621b5ddee5073f0fc2523af52d64085deee0decaff2ed8fbb60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:33:41.396978+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}